--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: e9620f8c34305754d8cc9a7e49e852d9, type: 3}
  m_Name: TutorialText_Destruction_en
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  m_LocaleId:
    m_Code: en
  m_SharedData: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e3b3d11cd33a43d493e2fd3c55997dfb, type: 2}
  m_Metadata:
    m_Items: []
  m_TableData:
  - m_Id: 137600815104
    m_Localized: "\u2026Hello. I\u2019m\n<#ff3333>Destruction</color>, and I\u2019ll
      be guiding you through this game\u2019s tutorial."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 180038782976
    m_Localized: "Let's get right to it\u2014I want you to understand the\n<#ff3333>notes</color>
      that make up this game.\nThis is essential knowledge for rhythm games."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 200582483968
    m_Localized: "First up is the basic element of rhythm games: \u201C<#ff3333>touch
      notes</color>.\u201D"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 241414033408
    m_Localized: "When this comes up, <#ffff00>tap</color> in time with the <#ff3333>yellow
      line</color>.\nI think it\u2019s best to try to tap in time with the rhythm
      as much as possible."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 271579467776
    m_Localized: Shall we give it a try right away?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 305708519424
    m_Localized: "Next up are these notes... \u201C<#ff3333>Hold Notes</color>\u201D"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 343302066176
    m_Localized: 'For this, just tap it once,

      <#ff3333>then keep it pressed
      until the end</color>.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 374218280960
    m_Localized: "Finally, there\u2019s no need to force yourself to let go.\nShall
      we give it a try right away?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 404954140672
    m_Localized: "That's great. Next up is \u201C<#ff3333>Dynamic Notes</color>.\u201D"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 477247164416
    m_Localized: 'After you touch it,

      you move your hand dynamically.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 504891822080
    m_Localized: "For example, with these notes, after you touch them,\ndon't be
      shy\u2014<#ff3333>raise your hand</color>."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 514140262400
    m_Localized: 'Dynamic notes come from all sorts of directions.

      <#ff3333>Just
      make a point of moving your hands in that direction</color>.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 544976785408
    m_Localized: Shall we give it a try?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 574009757696
    m_Localized: "\u201CSee... it's easy, right?\u201D"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 602514247680
    m_Localized: "Next up is this one: \u201C<#ff3333>Space Hold</color>.\u201D"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 626660855808
    m_Localized: 'It''s a bit of a tricky feeling, but hold your hand in the air

      <#ff3333>and
      keep it in position in sync with the notes</color>.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 668532592640
    m_Localized: 'Take a look at the example.

      It''s okay if it''s a little
      off-center.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 694956707840
    m_Localized: Well, give it a try.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 742243291136
    m_Localized: 'How''s it going? It might be tough at first, but

      you''ll
      get the hang of it little by little.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 769065865216
    m_Localized: "And this is the last one. \u201C<#ff3333>Space Break</color>.\u201D"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 794550456320
    m_Localized: "Just swing your <#ff3333>arm as hard as you can at the notes to
      destroy them</color>...!\nIt doesn't have to be just raising your arm\u2014a
      motion like a slap works too."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22405564711399424
    m_Localized: "Why don't you try playing your favorite song next\u2026?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22405557446864896
    m_Localized: Here comes the final note.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22405560961691648
    m_Localized: "\u2026Okay. That wraps up the tutorial.\nGood job."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  references:
    version: 2
    RefIds: []
